      <link>https://www.kunr.org/local-stories/2026-05-13/western-states-power-demand-day-ahead-heres-why</link>
      <description>Utilities across the West are launching a new regional energy market designed to help them buy and share power a full day before it’s needed — an effort supporters say could lower costs, improve reliability and make it easier to move renewable energy across state lines.</description>
